OL,3,GNEWSAChristian wins discrimination case
OL,4,Aover LGBT views                        
OL,6,FA company discriminated against a      
OL,7,FChristian social worker by not offering
OL,8,Fhim a job because of his religious     
OL,9,Fbeliefs on homosexuality, the Court of 
OL,10,FAppeal has ruled.                      
OL,12,FFelix Ngole was offered a role at      
OL,13,FTouchstone in 2022, but the Leeds-based
OL,14,Fmental health charity retracted a job  
OL,15,Foffer a month later after learning     
OL,16,Fabout news articles relating to a      
OL,17,Fprevious court case Ngole had been     
OL,18,Finvolved in.                           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
