OL,3,GNEWSAChristian wins discrimination case
OL,4,Aover LGBT views                        
OL,6,FIt involved a successful legal         
OL,7,Fchallenge against the University of    
OL,8,FSheffield over its decision to expel   
OL,9,Fhim from an MA course for social media 
OL,10,Fcomments Ngole made in 2015 stating    
OL,11,F"homosexuality is a sin".              
OL,13,FFollowing the latest decision, Ngole   
OL,14,Fsaid his religious beliefs did not make
OL,15,Fhim a "danger to others".              
